target_text.text:
Carbon intensity target (total net GHG emissions and removals expressed in tons of CO2 equivalent GWP AR4 per unit of GDP expressed in 1000 Tunisian Dinars at constant 2010 prices)                                                                                                                        
1) Unconditional target: reduction of 27% of carbon intensity  by 2030 compared to 2010 level ;
2) Conditional target: reduction of 45% of carbon intensity  by 2030 compared to 2010 level, subject to FTC support received
